@startuml sd_us227
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US227 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "RouteController" as RouteController
participant "CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase" as CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
participant "aircraft-maintenance\n(through aircraft-maintenance-local)" as OAM
== GET /api/routes/{origin}/{destination}/fuel-efficiency?aircraft={registration} ==
Actor -> EAR : GET /api/routes/{origin}/{destination}/fuel-efficiency?aircraft={registration}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> RouteController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
RouteController -> CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase : execute(...)
CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase -> OAM : C1: GET /internal/aircrafts/{registration}\n(the actor's token)
OAM --> CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase : 200 the aircraft: status, model, seats, range, fuel consumption
CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase -> DBAR : find route
alt held by this replica
DBAR --> CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase : route
CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase --> RouteController : result
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id)
else not held here (NotFoundException)
DBAR --> CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase : nothing
CalculateFuelEfficiencyUseCase --> RouteController : NotFoundException
RouteController -> PAR : same GET, X-Peer-Forwarded\n(every peer in parallel; 0.5 s to connect, 2 s to answer, one retry, circuit breaker)
PAR --> RouteController : 200 from the first peer that holds it
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id, X-Data-Node)
note over RouteController, PAR : 404 only if every peer answered without it;\n503 with Retry-After if a peer could not be asked
end
@enduml
